<title>JAPAN: Fuji Foods - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fuji Foods - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 32.20		vs	   29.98</p>
<p> Operating	  427    million	  vs	  986    million</p>
<p> Current	    355    million	  vs	  761    million</p>
<p> Net		  191    million	  vs	  279    million</p>
<p> EPS		   12.07 yen	  vs	   17.62 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     16 million	  vs	  16 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Fuji Foods Inc makes and markets prepared rice, delicatessen foods and sandwiches.</p>
